Main Features :
    User authentication
    JWT-based authentication
    Spring Security integration
    T-shirt/product management
    Product images
    Product listing
    Shopping cart functionality
    PostgreSQL database integration
    JPA/Hibernate persistence
    Stripe Sandbox payment integration
    MVC architecture
    Thymeleaf-based server-side rendering
    REST API development
    Admin-related functionality

Project Status :
    Practice / Learning Project

        This project was primarily created for learning and improving my understanding of Spring Boot and full-stack web application development.

        The application may continue to evolve as I learn more about Spring Boot, security, database design, software architecture, and production-level development.

